#IOP-ILB#
# SECRMAN's exports: its export table (ld.lld --irx-export, first in
# .text). The entries left out only return.
L secrman
V 0103
F 0000
E 000 _start
E 002 _exit
E 004 SecrSetMcCommandHandler
E 005 SecrSetMcDevIDHandler
E 006 SecrAuthCard
E 007 SecrResetAuthCard
E 008 SecrCardBootHeader
E 009 SecrCardBootBlock
E 010 SecrCardBootFile
E 011 SecrDiskBootHeader
E 012 SecrDiskBootBlock
E 013 SecrDiskBootFile
E 014 SecrDownloadHeader
E 015 SecrDownloadBlock
E 016 SecrDownloadFile
E 017 SecrDownloadGetKbit
E 018 SecrDownloadGetKc
E 019 SecrDownloadGetICVPS2
